# --- Test corpus -------------------------------------------------------------
# Third-party Australian government documents, vendored per THIRD_PARTY_DATA.md
# as extraction fixtures. Each value was read at the offset the scanner
# reported:
#
#   * Both PDF hits are body text behind a custom font encoding — the high
#     entropy is the encoding, not a secret. The reported token decodes to
#     ordinary prose under a three-letter shift ("7KHU…EOLF" is "The…blic").
#   * The CSV is the ACECQA approved-provider register (approval number, legal
#     name, trading name, street address); the offset lands mid-record on a
#     provider's name.

